training\", \"reject\", \"request_data\"], \"title\": \"Decision\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"evidence_ids\", \"issues\", \"rationale\", \"decision\"], \"title\": \"Answer\", \"type\": \"object\"}"
